      "sourceTextSha256": "1512e2d949c3488fc75893dc0d1e19a402f699cd608c27b9c2234bf84635e82c",
      "text": "Ten days through Chile in its finest hotels, The Singular and Nayara Alto Atacama: the wines of the Maipo Valley, sunset Pisco Sours in the Moon Valley and stargazing with drinks in the desert, a gourmet lunch at the Altiplanic lagoons, sunrise at El Tatio, the Grey Glacier by boat in Torres del Paine, and the colourful hills of Valparaíso.\n\n## Hotels and travel prices for 2027\n\nAccommodation: **The Singular Santiago** (2 nights), **Nayara Alto Atacama** (2 nights), **The Singular Santiago** (1 night), **The Singular Patagonia** (2 nights), **The Singular Santiago** (2 nights). A total of 9 nights. Breakfast (BB) and services as described are included.\n\n| Number of guests | Room type | Price per person |\n|---|---|---:|\n| 1 guest | SGL | $22,347 |\n| 2 guests | SGL | $17,800 |\n| 2 guests | DBL | $11,785 |\n| 3 guests | SGL | $16,558 |\n| 3 guests | DBL | $10,542 |\n| 3 guests | TRP | $9,998 |\n\nRates are per person in USD for travel in 2027. International flights, domestic flights (from USD 550, depending on the date of issue), travel insurance, meals not indicated, voluntary tips and bank fees are not included. A 5% fee applies to credit card payments.\n",
